english.9:
CLB. I have sinned against God. I confess before God, and before the
holy Mother of God, and before all the saints and before you, holy
fathers and brethren, all the sins which I have committed;

english.59:
And we believe in one Lord Jesus Christ, the Son of God, begotten of God the
Father, only-begotten, that is of the substance of the Father. God from God,
light from light, true God from true God, begotten and not made;
